        "TileImage": "$($repository 62755855-8f3c-4588-bcc1-8c30ac5c8314).Image",
        "Description": "Together, your primary two targets have concocted a scheme to defraud Ruben&apos;s workplace by robbing the bank vault, as well as holding thousands of people&apos;s bank information hostage under a false &apos;hacktivist&apos; persona. Deal with them with a tool from the vault, 47.\r\rAdditionally, Athena Savalas and her bodyguard must die to ensure bank management is in total chaos, as our client wishes to co-opt the data theft scheme to erase the bank&apos;s debt database. Neither are worth your pity, 47.",
